            "review_title": "Review at Luong Son Quan",
            "review_text": "Manfred Z\nStockholm, Sweden4 contributions\n0\nGreat food, but be aware of rats\nNov 2018 • Family\nWe had a late lunch / early dinner here, food was good. The place has a funny and unusual decore. I can almost eat at any place as long as the food is properly cooked. The problem most folk would have with this place is that there are small rats running around on the floor. My wife left the second she laid eyes on them but I had to finish my food first. \n\nI would probably not pick this place again, the food was good but it would be possible to find the same quality at another place without rats.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 3, 2019",
