            "review_text": "Mit_besten_Absichten\nLaoag, Philippines495 contributions\n0\nJust okay food slow and lazy service\nMay 2018 • Solo\nEarlier dinner after work this is suppose to be a hidden local treasure according to coworkers\n\nNot so sure what all the fuss is about, the food just ok, fresh, sauces nice and bitty, otherwise bland taste. \nNo cold beverages available, all served with ice.\nTypical floor seating, lots of big table, not really recommended for singles.\n\nWaiters rather play their mobile instead of asking for second orders, clearing table. This single guests seemed to be a burden....\n\nWould i go back?\n\nOnly if this place had a good clean up, change of service culture and better food.\nRead more\nWritten May 15, 2018",
