            "review_text": "cebolzappa\nIndonesia824 contributions\n0\nInteresting building\nAug 2017 • Business\nI was here for lunch; i rate very good because i never seen anything quite like it. The design of the place is very unique as if you are in rural area but also within a building; the food is good. We ordered a package for 7-8 people and a lot of variety. The pork ribs is very tender. The other food is typical Vietnamese cuisine, but instead of the typical 'fresh' ingredients this one is more on the meat; we got beef cooked with stone, steamed fish, jellyfish salad as always, sticky rice (taste like fried rice), chicken, calf, pork, bamboo, and i don't really remember the rest. If you have time kindly visit. The place is unique, for sure\nRead more\nWritten August 11, 2017",
